#Hello World
Hi, I'm [Francesco](https://sites.google.com/view/francescopicella), and I'm actually working active colloids.

![And yes, I use VI. Comic by [xkcd.](https://xkcd.com/378/)](https://imgs.xkcd.com/comics/real_programmers.png)

For this reason, I'm re-adapting [Arthur Ghigo](/sandbox/ghigo/src/) implementation of moving embedded boundaries.

## Forces/Torques on a moving embedded boundary
- A variation of classic [couette](/src/test/couette.c), but computing torques [couette_torque](test/couette_torque.c)

# Active/Passive particles in Stokes flows

### Stokes + Fluid Particle Method
 - [Force and torque free 2D cylindrical particle in plane Couette flow](/sandbox/fpicella/microswimmer_fluid_particle_dynamics/single_free_couette.c)

### Stokes + Embed

 - Single 2D cylindrical particle moving between flat plates [here for the main folder case](/sandbox/fpicella/cylinder_between_plates/).
 - [Sedimenting 2D cylindrical particle between flat plates](/sandbox/fpicella/cylinder_between_plates/sedimentation_driver_moving.c).
 - [Force-free 2D cylindrical particle in Couette flow](/sandbox/fpicella/cylinder_between_plates/plane_couette_force_torque_free_cylinder.c).

### *tHree*: 3-force model for microswimmers.

 - [Single tHree microswimmer, in a periodic domain](/sandbox/fpicella/microswimmer_tHree_forces/single_swimmer_base_case.c)
 - [Many _phototactic_ microswimmers](/sandbox/fpicella/microswimmer_tHree_forces/light_gradient.c). A novel repulsion method is used.
 - [Fingering instability (?)](/sandbox/fpicella/microswimmer_tHree_forces/fingering.c). Orientation is frozen.
 - [Plumes of bioconvection.](/sandbox/fpicella/microswimmer_tHree_forces/plumes_x_periodic.c). Primary instability from _hydrodynamic screening_?

### SuperHydroPhobic Surfaces.
 - [Rigid cylinder placed in a gas bubble under fluid flow](/sandbox/fpicella/cylinder_plastron/cylinder_plastron_online.c). Plastron dynamics
 - [Cylinder with single notch and a gas bubble](/sandbox/fpicella/cylinder_plastron/cylinder_single_notch_bubble.c). Free-interface dynamics and drag computation.
 
### Navier Boundary condition.
 - [Flow around a 2D embedded cylinder with partially slippery surfaces](/sandbox/fpicella/navier_BC/cylinder_embed_navier_explicit.c)

### Gas bubbles generating liquid droplets.
 - [Single gas bubble, rising in a quiescent bath, impacting a free-interface and generating a liquid droplet](rising_bubble_to_droplet/axi_rising_bubble_to_droplet.c)
 - [Single gas bubble rising in a quiescent bath, without coalescence and with particles seeded in the liquid phase.](https://basilisk.fr/sandbox/fpicella/rising_bubble_to_droplet/axi_particles_no_coalescence.c)

